<title>UK: Christies says to auction Ganz collection.</title>
<headline>Christies says to auction Ganz collection.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-based auctioneer and art specialist Christies International Plc on Tuesday said it has been selected to auction the Victor and Sally Ganz collection.</p>
<p>The collection is expected to realise more than $125 million, which is the highest estimate for any single-owner sale, Christies said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the Ganz collection was the greatest private collection of 20th Century Art ever offered at auction by a single collector.</p>
<p>The auction will take place at Christie's in New York on November 10, 1997.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
